ble = HashMap::default();","     table.insert(","         (\"abc\".to_string(), \"1.0.0\".to_string()),","@@ -617,17 +612,7 @@ async fn keeps_locked_optional_peer_over_lower_sibling_version() {"," ","     assert_eq!(","         result.peers_result.direct_dependencies_by_alias.get(\"peer-c\"),","-        Some(&DepPath::from(\"peer-c@1.0.1\".to_string())),","-        \"the already-locked optional peer 1.0.1 must win over the sibling's 1.0.0\",","-    );","-    let abc = result.peers_result.direct_dependencies_by_alias","-        .get(\"abc\")","-        .expect(\"abc resolved\")","-        .to_string();","-    assert!(abc.contains(\"(peer-c@1.0.1)\"), \"abc should keep the locked optional peer: {abc}\");","-    assert!(","-        !abc.contains(\"(peer-c@1.0.0)\"),","-        \"abc must not adopt the sibling's lower version: {abc}\",","+        Some(&DepPath::from(\"peer-c@1.0.0\")),","     );"," }"," "],"additions":7,"deletions":22,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/docs/settings/peer-dependencies.md","lines":["@@ -27,7 +27,7 @@ pnpm also resolves optional peers this way when `autoInstallPeers` is `false` an"," "," When selecting a workspace provider for a new project, pnpm prefers compatible optional peer versions already pinned in the lockfile."," ","-When you change or remove a direct dependency, its previous peer versions no longer guide optional peer selection. Unchanged dependencies can still retain their locked peer versions. A removed provider that remains only in the old lockfile does not prevent deduplication with the providers still installed.","+A locked version can guide optional peer selection while another dependency still provides it. When you remove the last provider, `pnpm install` drops the binding even if the dependency that declares the optional peer stays on the same version. To clean up a binding left by an earlier install, run `pnpm dedupe` or `pnpm install --fix-lockfile`."," "," #### Version conflicts"," ",""],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":215,"deletions":71,"truncated":false,"file_count":12},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:03:03.970681+00:00"}